zotero-staticsync-sync-partial-failure = { $count } items failed to sync.
zotero-staticsync-error-no-collection = Please select a Zotero collection first, or set Export Scope to "Entire library".
zotero-staticsync-error-empty-collection = No regular Zotero items were found in this collection.
zotero-staticsync-error-invalid-group-id = The Zotero Group ID could not be resolved. Check the ID in your group settings URL.
zotero-staticsync-supabase-password-prompt = Enter a password for this shared collection. Leave it empty for public access.
zotero-staticsync-pref-status-field-help = Collection uses the full collection path. Library uses the Zotero library name.
zotero-staticsync-pref-share-base-url-help = Use a full URL with {id}, or a page URL that accepts ?id=...
zotero-staticsync-pref-export-scope-help = Controls which items are included when you run a sync. "Library" does not require a selected collection.
zotero-staticsync-pref-group-id-help = Numeric group ID shown in the Zotero group settings URL. Leave blank to use your personal library.
zotero-staticsync-pref-fixed-slug-help = Stable URL identifier for this collection. Leave blank to auto-generate from the collection name.
zotero-staticsync-pref-sync-profile-help = Static mode pushes data and stops. Collaborative mode polls for web-side actions and applies them to Zotero.
zotero-staticsync-pref-poll-interval-help = How often Zotero checks for pending actions from the web. Minimum 10, recommended 30-120.
zotero-staticsync-pref-default-password-help = Pre-filled password for new shares. Can be overridden per-sync. Leave blank for public access.
